any|respected|rapport|V26@1:45:43|There's a lot to be said for something that works so well.|Honour what works. Gratitude lands well.|adapted|Works well with a content, steady person
any|heard|rapport|V26@1:49:17|I'd really like to hear how you're doing, not just about everyone else.|Warm, gentle, unhurried. They may deflect, so ask again kindly.|adapted|Works well with someone who always puts others first
any|heard|rapport|V26@1:49:17|What's going on for you at the moment?|Warm, gentle, unhurried. They may deflect, so ask again kindly.|adapted|Works well with someone who always puts others first
any|appreciated|rapport|V26@1:49:47|Hearing about you gives me something, it doesn't take anything away.|Reframe so that being known is a gift to you.|source-example|Works well with someone who always puts others first
any|appreciated|rapport|V26@1:49:47|It makes me feel good to be able to help you.|Reframe so that being known is a gift to you.|source-example|Works well with someone who always puts others first
any|trusted|disagree|V26@1:51:17|I'm giving you this feedback because I want you to succeed.|Frame hard feedback as help; this is how Vanessa says good helper-managers do it.|source-example|Works well with someone who always puts others first
